{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/c6451f193b00c38fc26c95d45c6e4dfc.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gordy and her punk band, Dead Pets, have been playing together for\u2026 a while, and have never made it big. Heading into their 30s, their personal responsibilities and the band's uncertain future is looming over them. Do they have what it takes to give Dead Pets one last shot at success? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/d32f49a5d70f6837cb69c25e07574dd7.poster.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/d32f49a5d70f6837cb69c25e07574dd7.webm?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/d32f49a5d70f6837cb69c25e07574dd7.mp4?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/5989fafbaa2ae615bbc4a9a455dacfcb.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Pets Unleashed is a feminist, management-lite, minigame-heavy, slice-of-life, narrative game; about music, friendship, and maturing. Playing as Gordy, you\u2019ll go to band practice, manage Gordy\u2019s finances, her wellbeing, and try to find enough time and money to cover... well, everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gordy's life is a mess. Decide where Gordy\u2019s priorities lie to shape the future of the band. With different endings, you'll have the chance to help Gordy grow in a ton of different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/b548fc57d50dae7a91441fe7e5a725c4.poster.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/b548fc57d50dae7a91441fe7e5a725c4.webm?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/b548fc57d50dae7a91441fe7e5a725c4.mp4?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/746e87714ad4d97868f2c3dcd413ccd2.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-term friendships can be messy, especially when everyone grows up at their own pace. Can you stop a job, a relationship or a lifestyle from hurting the band?<br><br>On top of everything else, the band's first taste of success comes at the cost of Gordy\u2019s mental health and physical wellbeing. Just how much is she willing to sacrifice for fame? Or for justice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/1b2cf39fa8470d442c74c4e6b7203ae0.poster.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/1b2cf39fa8470d442c74c4e6b7203ae0.webm?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/1b2cf39fa8470d442c74c4e6b7203ae0.mp4?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/11dc0a2013cbd4bb3674354acfb8037e.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of Welcome to Elk, dive into the demon world of New Void City, and give your childhood dreams one last chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time to get loud, grow up, and rock out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/8fbb8a1a7c37ba0df5ac31791455bf95.poster.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/8fbb8a1a7c37ba0df5ac31791455bf95.webm?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/8fbb8a1a7c37ba0df5ac31791455bf95.mp4?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1851720?t=1762207783","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1851720?t=1762207783","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/1966ff8ebc0f3ae5efedf8088573d0131bf05b56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762207783","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/1966ff8ebc0f3ae5efedf8088573d0131bf05b56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762207783","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Content Warning: Dead Pets Unleashed will contain a major storyline relating to sexual assault and harassment. \r\n\r\nThere is an implied sexual assault that occurs towards the end of Episode 2 of the demo. There is a content warning in-game before the scene takes place, and you'll have the choice to skip over the specific scene if you choose. "},"demos":[{"appid":2106980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1> </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/2effbb292dda800dbec84bb7b24f5f68.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killer Soundtrack:</strong> Dead Pets Unleashed features a punk rock EP performed during the game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames for Days: </strong> Including working a shift at a diner (diner dash), rhythm games, and making hot dogs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Demon City filled with Life: </strong>New Void City is filled with NPCs to befriend, with their own storylines. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Success is in Your Hands:</strong> There will be multiple endings - with the success of the band determined by your choices throughout the game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoonish Inspirations:</strong> For fans of Bojack Horseman and Tuca and Bertie. We were inspired by their colorful, surreal worlds, long-term and complicated adult friends, and zany, offbeat humor. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Choices:</strong> Every choice affects Gordy's wellbeing, the band's power, her social points, or costs money. </p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/c6451f193b00c38fc26c95d45c6e4dfc.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gordy and her punk band, Dead Pets, have been playing together for\u2026 a while, and have never made it big. Heading into their 30s, their personal responsibilities and the band's uncertain future is looming over them. Do they have what it takes to give Dead Pets one last shot at success? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/d32f49a5d70f6837cb69c25e07574dd7.poster.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/d32f49a5d70f6837cb69c25e07574dd7.webm?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/d32f49a5d70f6837cb69c25e07574dd7.mp4?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/5989fafbaa2ae615bbc4a9a455dacfcb.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Pets Unleashed is a feminist, management-lite, minigame-heavy, slice-of-life, narrative game; about music, friendship, and maturing. Playing as Gordy, you\u2019ll go to band practice, manage Gordy\u2019s finances, her wellbeing, and try to find enough time and money to cover... well, everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gordy's life is a mess. Decide where Gordy\u2019s priorities lie to shape the future of the band. With different endings, you'll have the chance to help Gordy grow in a ton of different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/b548fc57d50dae7a91441fe7e5a725c4.poster.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/b548fc57d50dae7a91441fe7e5a725c4.webm?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/b548fc57d50dae7a91441fe7e5a725c4.mp4?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/746e87714ad4d97868f2c3dcd413ccd2.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-term friendships can be messy, especially when everyone grows up at their own pace. Can you stop a job, a relationship or a lifestyle from hurting the band?<br><br>On top of everything else, the band's first taste of success comes at the cost of Gordy\u2019s mental health and physical wellbeing. Just how much is she willing to sacrifice for fame? Or for justice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/1b2cf39fa8470d442c74c4e6b7203ae0.poster.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/1b2cf39fa8470d442c74c4e6b7203ae0.webm?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/1b2cf39fa8470d442c74c4e6b7203ae0.mp4?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/11dc0a2013cbd4bb3674354acfb8037e.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of Welcome to Elk, dive into the demon world of New Void City, and give your childhood dreams one last chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time to get loud, grow up, and rock out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/8fbb8a1a7c37ba0df5ac31791455bf95.poster.avif?t=1762207783\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/8fbb8a1a7c37ba0df5ac31791455bf95.webm?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/extras/8fbb8a1a7c37ba0df5ac31791455bf95.mp4?t=1762207783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Triple Topping","Akupara Games"],"dlc":[2561930],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851720/bd1363d1deb306085bf3942ad4dbadf5ea86b691/header.jpg?t=1762207783","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Akupara Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum